timestamp=2026-11-24T05:50:03.563Z level=INFO run=2c4c988f message=evaluated permission=bash pattern=".venv/bin/python - <<'EOF'\nimport json,glob,os\nfor f in sorted(glob.glob('work/prod_test2/*.json')):\n    ds=os.path.basename(f); a=json.load(open(f)); b=json.load(open('work/prod_test/'+ds))\n    if a!=b:\n        ai={i['reference_rapport']:i for i in a['interventions']}; bi={i['reference_rapport']:i for i in b['interventions']}\n        for r in set(ai)|set(bi):\n            if r not in ai or r not in bi: print('REFDIFF',ds,r); continue\n            for k in ai[r]:\n                if ai[r].get(k)!=bi[r].get(k): print(ds,r,k,bi[r].get(k),'->',ai[r].get(k))\nEOF" action.permission=bash action.action=allow action.pattern=*
